### 1. Assign Single Teacher to Subject (School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

{
  "teacherId": "{{teacherId}}",
  "subjectId": "{{subjectId}}"
}

### 2. Bulk Assign Subjects to Teacher (School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bulk
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

{
  "teacherId": "{{teacherId}}",
  "subjectIds": [
    "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001",
    "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174002"
  ]
}

### 3. Sync/Replace All Subject Assignments for Teacher (School Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sync
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

{
  "teacherId": "{{teacherId}}",
  "subjectIds": [
    "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001"
  ]
}

### 4. Get All Subjects Assigned to a Teacher (Authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teacher/{{teacherId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{parentOrStudentToken}}

### 5. Get All Teachers Assigned to a Subject (Authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subject/{{subjectId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{parentOrStudentToken}}

### 6. Remove Teacher from Subject Assignment (School Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teacher/{{teacherId}}/subject/{{subjectId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}